      "Larger scoop and slightly more calories than the isolates",
      "Too sweet for some buyers as a daily shake"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The birthday cake tub to buy if price per gram comes first.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "25 g (brand)",
      "Calories": "About 130 (database)",
      "Sweeteners": "Check panel",
      "Best for": "Value, dessert shakes"
    }
  },
  {
