      "2 g of sugar and synthetic food dyes from the granules",
      "No certification listed on the retailer page we checked"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "Worth it for the sprinkles and the treat factor, not for value.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "25 g (label)",
      "Calories": "120",
      "Sweeteners": "Sucralose, sugar in granules",
