                  Most do not. ISO100, PEScience, Legion, RYSE and Clean Simple Eats get their flavor from natural and artificial flavors only. RAW CBUM Itholate Birthday Cake is the exception: its label lists multicolored granules made from sugar, corn syrup, corn starch and food dyes, which add color, a slight crunch and about 2 g of sugar per scoop.
                </p>
