                  It can fit a weight loss plan. ISO100 and Legion deliver 22 to 25 g of protein for about 120 calories with little sugar, per their labels, and protein helps with fullness. A powder only supports weight loss inside an overall calorie deficit, and dessert flavors are easy to overuse, so measure scoops rather than pouring by eye.
